# Restless Anchorage enters tapped on turn 1 and is a plain land. On turn 3 Bot1 pays {1}{W}{U} with three Moxen and
# animates it: until end of turn it is a 2/3 white and blue Bird land creature with flying (CR 613.1d, 613.4b). It attacks
# beside an Elvish Mystic. Bot2's Llanowar Elves may block the ground attacker but not the Anchorage, which flies
# (the refusal beside its control: the same Elves do block the Mystic). Attacking creates a Map token, and the Anchorage
# deals 2 unblocked. On turn 4 the effect is gone: it is only a Land again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Restless Anchorage
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x14

[Actions]
